---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="Affiliate disclosure for Small Space Style: this site earns commissions from affiliate links at no extra cost to readers."
>
  <section class="page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p>
        <strong>Small Space Style contains affiliate links.</strong>
        If you buy through them, I may earn a commission at no extra cost
        to you.
      </p>
      <p>
        That is how this site is funded. It does not change what I
        recommend: picks are chosen on size, material, price and fit for
        small spaces first, and the affiliate link is added second. A
        product is never recommended only because it pays a commission.
      </p>
      <p>
        Prices, sizes and availability change often. Always check the
        retailer's page before you buy — the price on the retailer page is
        the one that counts, not any price quoted here.
      </p>
      <p>
        This disclosure is shown at the top of every post that contains
        affiliate links, and in the footer of every page, in line with the
        US Federal Trade Commission's endorsement guidelines and India's
        ASCI disclosure requirements.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
